script 6 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"그럼 가기로 한 거지…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"물론이지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"미소라가 이렇게까지 해서\n우리를 초대해 줬는데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"미소라를 기쁘게 해 주려면\n가야 하지 않겠어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"야호!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아 맞다! 촬영이 끝나면\n스튜디오에서\n콘서트도 할 예정이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너희도 꼭\n보러 와!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"좋아! 네 라이브 공연을\n한동안 못 들었거든."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"응, 다른 일로 바빴어.\n하지만 노래하는 게 내\n진짜 열정이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"다시 무대에 오를 생각을 하니\n정말 기대돼!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"TV 프로그램 촬영과\n콘서트는 정확히\n어디서 하는 거야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"[Area0016]에서!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"아, 그 스튜디오라면 알아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사람과 위저드가 함께 일하는\n새로운 스튜디오야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"TV 프로그램을\n만드는 곳이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"맞아!\n내 프로그램 감독님도\n위저드야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"정말 멋지다…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Sonia
	"정말 괜찮겠어?\n스튜디오가 꽤\n멀리 있잖아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"문제없어!\n너를 위해서라면 뭐든지\n할 수 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"곤타, 나를 위해서라면\n그 정도까지 해 줄 거야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"피자 같은 보상만 해 준다면\n그럴지도…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
